.TH MENU_CENTER 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
menu_center \- Position the menu block in the middle of the logical screen based on its widest label and item count
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqmenu.h\(dq
.BI "void menu_center(Menu *m, Engine *e);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Position the menu block in the middle of the logical screen based on its widest label and item count. Call after the last menu_add.
.SH MODULE
menu (src/engine/menu/menu.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR menu_init (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
